<p>Greenland’s Prime Minister Jens-Frederik Nielsen and the Danish government rejected President Trump’s proposal to send a U.S. hospital ship to Greenland, after the President said he wanted to help “many people who are sick” and “not being taken care of” on the island. Nielsen said Greenland already has a public healthcare system that provides free treatment for citizens. He added that Greenland remains open to dialogue and cooperation with the United States, as long as it is respectful of Greenland’s domestic decisions. Denmark’s Defence Minister Troels Lund Poulsen said Greenlanders already get the healthcare they need in Greenland or, for specialized care, in Denmark, and he called the U.S. offer unnecessary.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/g4TMdG1Ip_H6q4AMNVYgJe-2nvna4whPG6iU5Prhq16hQmkXnR_xeQVx3g0YdDnsTGG1ovRS5H4LwRcJunXLsiU7vWVAdM1tbU2FCJm6RnvU' alt='The Nuuk Hospital in Nuuk, Greenland (file photo).' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Ships’ readiness: One report said both U.S. Navy hospital ships were docked at a shipyard in Alabama at the time of the proposal.</li><li>Healthcare footprint: Greenland has five regional hospitals.</li><li>Evacuation incident: Separately from the political exchange, Danish forces evacuated a crew member from a U.S. submarine near Greenland after an urgent request for medical care, according to one report.</li><li>White House setting: One report said the announcement appeared on social media shortly before President Trump hosted a dinner for Republican governors at the White House, where he sat next to Louisiana Governor Jeff Landry.</li></ul><blockquote>It&#x27;s a no thank you from here. - Jens-Frederik Nielsen</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Government of Greenland: Prime Minister Jens-Frederik Nielsen said Greenland’s publicly funded system already provides free care, urged the U.S. to “talk to us” rather than make social-media pronouncements, and said cooperation is welcome as long as Greenland’s domestic decisions are respected. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/632909-no-thank-you-greenland-pm/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Government of Denmark: Defence Minister Troels Lund Poulsen said Greenland’s population already gets the treatment it needs locally or, for specialized care, in Denmark, and argued there is no need for a separate U.S. healthcare initiative. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1975113/greenland-denmark-reject-trumps-hospital-ship-offer'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>White House: President Trump said a “great hospital boat” would go to Greenland to treat people he claimed were “not being taken care of,” without providing details on a specific deployment. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cy7jnvdzpr7o'>BBC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/greenland-prime-minister-says-no-thank-you-to-trumps-hospital-ship'>Greenland prime minister says &#x27;no thank you&#x27; to Trump&#x27;s hospital ship</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/thanks-but-no-thanks-to-trumps-hospital-ship-plan-greenlands-response-11122526#publisher=newsstand'>&#x27;Thanks, But No Thanks&#x27;: To Trump&#x27;s Hospital Ship Plan, Greenland&#x27;s Response</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-greenland-prime-minister-says-no-thanks-to-trumps-hospital-ship/'>Greenland prime minister says ‘no thanks’ to Trump’s hospital ship</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/02/22/2026/denmark-rejects-us-offer-to-send-hospital-boat-to-greenland'>Denmark rejects US offer to send hospital boat to Greenland</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/632909-no-thank-you-greenland-pm/'>‘No thank you’: Greenland PM sinks Trump hospital ship idea</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-he-is-sending-a-hospital-ship-to-greenland/article70662642.ece'>Greenland, Denmark say ‘no thanks’, as Trump says he is sending hospital ship to Greenland</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/no-thanks-greenland-pm-rejects-trumps-proposal-to-send-us-navy-hospital-ship-13982536.html'>‘No thanks’: Greenland PM rejects Trump’s proposal to send US Navy hospital ship</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/22/greenland-reiterates-its-public-healthcare-amid-us-hospital-ship-proposal'>Greenland rejects Trump’s offer to send US hospital ship to Arctic island</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1975113/greenland-denmark-reject-trumps-hospital-ship-offer'>Greenland, Denmark reject Trump’s hospital ship offer</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/greenland-prime-minister-says-no-thanks-to-trumps-hospital-ship'>Greenland prime minister says &#x27;no thanks&#x27; to Trump&#x27;s hospital ship</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/cy7jnvdzpr7o'>Greenland says &#x27;no thanks&#x27; to Trump US hospital boat</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/02/22/greenland-and-denmark-reject-us-hospital-ship-offered-by-trump_6750744_5.html'>Greenland and Denmark say &#x27;No Thanks&#x27; to Trump&#x27;s hospital ship offer</a> - lemonde.fr</li></ul>